      "text": "Observability and reliability:\n- Monitoring service \n       - LLM response time\n       - Retrieval accuracy + time\n       - Confidence\n       - DB Latency\n       - Token usage\n       - Error rates\n       - tool call success/failure? ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
