      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Observability and reliability:\n- Monitoring service \n       - LLM response time\n       - Retrieval accuracy + time\n       - Confidence\n       - DB Latency\n       - Token usage\n       - Error rates\n       - tool call success/failure? ",
